## The 4 structural problems

| # | Problem | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Subprocessor list = 3 representations, 2 departments, out of sync | Standalone list **2026-04-28** (InfoSec) is *newer* than "authoritative" Appendix B **2026-02-25** (in a customer's DPA); VENDOR MASTER SHEET is a 3rd form |
| 2 | Templates ≠ latest | SLA "template" = retired **90%**; canonical **99%** sits in KPMG folder; a draft floats separately |
| 3 | DPA duplication | Hosting DPA in InfoSec `2. DPA` + Sales&CS templates (2 variants) + per-customer; Marketplace DPA "template" vs authoritative copy in a customer folder |
| 4 | No declared source-of-truth pointer | Nothing links the two departments' copies; no "this is canonical" marker |

