## Alternatives

| Alt | Approach | Pros | Cons | Verdict |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **1** | Consolidate all under **InfoSec** (governance-led) | Governance, versioning, master sheet, auditor evidence already here | SLA/DPA templates are commercial artifacts sales edits daily; readme says don't add folders | Partial |
| **2** | Consolidate all under **Sales & CS / Contracts** (commercial-led) | Templates + sales workflow already here | Splits governance: master sheet, archive, signed-DPA store, auditor evidence live in InfoSec | Partial |
| **3** | **Split by document *nature*** — each artifact one home by what it is | Sustainable, **zero migration**, no broken links/Vanta refs, respects readme; index = future move checklist | Still two physical homes (mitigated by index + fixing staleness) | ✅ **Recommended** |
| **4** | New top-level **"Legal & Contracts"** home | One clean home | Heavy migration, breaks links + Vanta/auditor refs, violates readme, splits governance from ISMS | ❌ Rejected |

